{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108280","id":2641764213,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ddh91","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108280","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108280.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108280.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108280","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108280/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108280/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108280/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7e91696d3e05d281c9c5e2458033119c8e60d445","number":108280,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix TextServer::shaped_text_get_grapheme_bounds() returning the bounds of the wrong grapheme","user":{"login":"bs-mwoerner","id":35597337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk3MzM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35597337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner","html_url":"https://github.com/bs-mwoerner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #108269.\r\n\r\nA text of \"abc\" produces three glyphs with start/end pairs of (0, 1), (1, 2), and (2, 3), so apparently `end` is exclusive. This means that this condition for when the correct position is reached leads to an off-by-one error:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9b22b41531c82132732fda0f9818c5709c2587bc/servers/text_server.cpp#L1635\r\n\r\nIf `p_pos == 1` (we want the bounds of character index 1) and `glyph[0].start == 0` and `glyph[0].end == 1`, then this will already be true for `i == 0` and return the position of the first glyph instead of the second.\r\n\r\nThis is a rather fundamental change for something that's been like this for four years, so maybe there's quite a bit of code out there that compensates for this behavior and would produce incorrect results if we fix it? Then again, just having it return incorrect values forever doesn't feel quite right either.\r\n\r\n*Edit:* Oh, wow, this change fails *all* the test cases. 😳 Maybe it was actually inteded that way and the better route would be to document that this function and functions that use it use 1-based indexing?\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n\t\t\tSEND_GUI_MOUSE_BUTTON_EVENT(text_edit->get_rect_at_line_column(1, 0).get_center(), MouseButton::LEFT, MouseButtonMask::LEFT, Key::NONE);\r\n\t\t\t// Add (2,0) to bring it past the center point of the grapheme and account for integer division flooring.\r\n\t\t\tSEND_GUI_MOUSE_MOTION_EVENT(text_edit->get_rect_at_line_column(1, 5).get_center() + Point2i(2, 0), MouseButtonMask::LEFT, Key::NONE);\r\n\t\t\tCHECK(text_edit->has_selection());\r\n\t\t\tCHECK(text_edit->get_selected_text() == \"for s\");\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis test case clicks at the center of character 0, drags a bit past the center of character 5, and expects to then have 5 characters selected. Is that what we want? I'm confused.\r\n\r\n```\r\n012345\r\nfor se\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-07-04T15:00:10Z","updated_at":"2025-07-04T16:43:29Z","closed_at":"2025-07-04T16:33:19Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9918038553da47bf3154bacf592dbcebbaef9e7d","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"bs-mwoerner:fix_get_grapheme_bounds","ref":"fix_get_grapheme_bounds","repo":{"id":704937540,"node_id":"R_kgDOKgR-RA","name":"godot","full_name":"bs-mwoerner/godot","owner":{"login":"bs-mwoerner","id":35597337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk3MzM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35597337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner","html_url":"https://github.com/bs-mwoerner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_